Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.44,Hook,,0,0,0,,NADIE SE RIÓ DE SU\NCHISTE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:02.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Saben qué hace un perro\Ncon un taladro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué hace?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Taladrando!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:10.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Tremendo silencio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:11.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Escúchenme una cosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.61,0:00:12.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Que sea la última vez
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.98,0:00:14.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}que no se ríen cuando hago\Nun chiste
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:16.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a contar el mismo\Nchiste
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:17.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}y se cagan de risa los\Ncuatro, ¿ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.99,0:00:19.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}O los rajo a vos, a vos, a\Nvos y a vos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.81,0:00:20.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Quedó claro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:21.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Vamos de vuelta, entonces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué hace un perro con un\Ntaladro?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.73,0:00:25.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué hace?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.93,0:00:27.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Taladrando!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:31.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Pero por qué cobró él?\N¿Por qué él?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Por qué Teo?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:40.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Por qué cobró Teo?
